      "countAsQuest:1": 1,
      "desc:8": "Each gun takes one kind of ammunition. Loose rounds (Stone Bullets, 9mm Bullets, Shotgun Shells, Rifle Bullets) go straight into guns such as the Hand Cannon, Revolver, Sawed Off and Bolt Action Rifle. Pistols, SMGs and assault rifles take magazines, which are filled from loose rounds.\n\nHold any round or a loaded magazine to complete this quest. Stone Bullets are the easy ones: three cobblestone, a gunpowder and a bronze nugget at a crafting table make sixteen.\n\nSneak and right-click a magazine to empty it back into loose rounds and an empty magazine, so nothing you press is ever wasted.\n\n[note]Ammo is the real cost of a gun. The Ammo Logistics chapter shows how to build a proper production line.[/note]",
